                        </ul>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th>Keahlian Utama</th>
                    <td>Software Development (Front-End-Back-End), Networking & Infrastructure, System Troubleshooting</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="btn-navigation-container">
            <button class="btn-action" onclick="pindahHalaman('halaman-kuisoner')">
                Selanjutnya -> 
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page-section" id="halaman-kuisoner">
        <h1 class="main-title">Kuesioner Evaluasi</h1>

        <div class="glass-card">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 8px;">Silahkan Isi Kuesioner Ini</h2>
            <p style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 15px;">
                Mohon luangkan waktu sejenak untuk memberikan penilaian secara objektif mengenai tampilan dan kualitas informasi pada halaman profil web ini.
            </p>

            <div id="alreadyFilledBanner" class="completed-banner" style="display: none;">
                ⚠️ <strong>Perhatian:</strong> Anda sudah pernah mengisi kuesioner ini. Anda tidak dapat mengirimkan respons ulang.
            </div>

            <div class="instruction-box">
                <strong>Tujuan:</strong> Mengetahui respon pengguna terhadap tampilan, kejelasan informasi karier, dan kemudahan membaca (usability) pada halaman profil web.
                <div class="likert-scale-guide">
                    <span>1 = Sangat Tidak Setuju</span>
                    <span>2 = Tidak Setuju</span>
                    <span>3 = Netral</span>
                    <span>4 = Setuju</span>
                    <span>5 = Sangat Setuju</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <form id="kuesionerForm">
                
                <div class="question-item" id="q1_container">
                    <div class="question-title">1. Desain & Animasi: Desain visual web (termasuk efek gradient background bergerak dan kartu transparan/glassmorphism) terlihat menarik dan modern.</div>
                    <div class="rating-options">
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q1" value="1" id="q1_1"><label for="q1_1">1</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q1" value="2" id="q1_2"><label for="q1_2">2</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q1" value="3" id="q1_3"><label for="q1_3">3</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q1" value="4" id="q1_4"><label for="q1_4">4</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q1" value="5" id="q1_5"><label for="q1_5">5</label></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="question-item" id="q2_container">
                    <div class="question-title">2. Keterbacaan Teks: Kombinasi warna teks dan latar belakang terasa nyaman di mata serta mudah dibaca.</div>
                    <div class="rating-options">
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q2" value="1" id="q2_1"><label for="q2_1">1</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q2" value="2" id="q2_2"><label for="q2_2">2</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q2" value="3" id="q2_3"><label for="q2_3">3</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q2" value="4" id="q2_4"><label for="q2_4">4</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q2" value="5" id="q2_5"><label for="q2_5">5</label></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="question-item" id="q3_container">
                    <div class="question-title">3. Tata Letak (Layout): Penataan posisi judul, sub-judul, dan tabel profil tersusun secara rapi dan konsisten.</div>
                    <div class="rating-options">
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q3" value="1" id="q3_1"><label for="q3_1">1</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q3" value="2" id="q3_2"><label for="q3_2">2</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q3" value="3" id="q3_3"><label for="q3_3">3</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q3" value="4" id="q3_4"><label for="q3_4">4</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q3" value="5" id="q3_5"><label for="q3_5">5</label></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="question-item" id="q4_container">
                    <div class="question-title">4. Responsivitas: Tampilan web dapat menyesuaikan diri dengan baik di berbagai ukuran layar (HP / Laptop / Tablet).</div>
                    <div class="rating-options">
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q4" value="1" id="q4_1"><label for="q4_1">1</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q4" value="2" id="q4_2"><label for="q4_2">2</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q4" value="3" id="q4_3"><label for="q4_3">3</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q4" value="4" id="q4_4"><label for="q4_4">4</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q4" value="5" id="q4_5"><label for="q4_5">5</label></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="question-item" id="q5_container">
                    <div class="question-title">5. Kejelasan Informasi Profil: Latar belakang pendidikan dan transisi karier dari Network Engineer ke Full Stack Developer tersampaikan dengan sangat jelas.</div>
                    <div class="rating-options">
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q5" value="1" id="q5_1"><label for="q5_1">1</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q5" value="2" id="q5_2"><label for="q5_2">2</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q5" value="3" id="q5_3"><label for="q5_3">3</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q5" value="4" id="q5_4"><label for="q5_4">4</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q5" value="5" id="q5_5"><label for="q5_5">5</label></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="question-item" id="q6_container">
                    <div class="question-title">6. Kejelasan Keahlian Utama: Ringkasan keahlian utama (Software Development, Networking, Troubleshooting) mudah dipahami.</div>
                    <div class="rating-options">
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q6" value="1" id="q6_1"><label for="q6_1">1</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q6" value="2" id="q6_2"><label for="q6_2">2</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q6" value="3" id="q6_3"><label for="q6_3">3</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q6" value="4" id="q6_4"><label for="q6_4">4</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q6" value="5" id="q6_5"><label for="q6_5">5</label></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="question-item" id="q7_container">
                    <div class="question-title">7. Format Penyajian Tabel: Penyajian ringkasan profil dalam format tabel memudahkan pembaca dalam memindai (scan) informasi penting.</div>
                    <div class="rating-options">
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q7" value="1" id="q7_1"><label for="q7_1">1</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q7" value="2" id="q7_2"><label for="q7_2">2</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q7" value="3" id="q7_3"><label for="q7_3">3</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q7" value="4" id="q7_4"><label for="q7_4">4</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q7" value="5" id="q7_5"><label for="q7_5">5</label></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="question-item" id="q8_container">
                    <div class="question-title">8. Kesan Profesionalisme: Halaman profil ini memberikan kesan yang profesional untuk sebuah portofolio kandidat IT.</div>
                    <div class="rating-options">
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q8" value="1" id="q8_1"><label for="q8_1">1</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q8" value="2" id="q8_2"><label for="q8_2">2</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q8" value="3" id="q8_3"><label for="q8_3">3</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q8" value="4" id="q8_4"><label for="q8_4">4</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q8" value="5" id="q8_5"><label for="q8_5">5</label></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="question-item" id="q9_container">
                    <div class="question-title">9. Kecepatan Memahami: Pengguna dapat memahami siapa pemilik profil dan kualifikasinya secara cepat (dibawah 1 menit).</div>
                    <div class="rating-options">
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q9" value="1" id="q9_1"><label for="q9_1">1</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q9" value="2" id="q9_2"><label for="q9_2">2</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q9" value="3" id="q9_3"><label for="q9_3">3</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q9" value="4" id="q9_4"><label for="q9_4">4</label></div>
                        <div class="rating-btn"><input type="radio" name="q9" value="5" id="q9_5"><label for="q9_5">5</label></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="question-item" id="q10_container">
                    <div class="question-title">10. Rekomendasi Fitur Tambahan: Fitur/elemen apa yang perlu ditambahkan agar web profil ini semakin lengkap? (Pilih satu atau lebih)</div>
                    
                    <div class="checkbox-group">
                        <label class="checkbox-item">
                            <input type="checkbox" name="q10_option" value="Showcase Portofolio Proyek"> Showcase Portofolio Proyek / Aplikasi
                        </label>
                        <label class="checkbox-item">
                            <input type="checkbox" name="q10_option" value="Tombol Kontak Langsung"> Tombol Kontak Langsung (WhatsApp/LinkedIn)
                        </label>
                        <label class="checkbox-item">
                            <input type="checkbox" name="q10_option" value="Fitur Unduh CV"> Fitur Unduh CV (PDF)
                        </label>
                        <label class="checkbox-item">
                            <input type="checkbox" name="q10_option" value="Mode Terang / Gelap"> Toggle Light/Dark Mode
                        </label>
                    </div>

                    <input type="text" class="text-input-field" id="q10_catatan" placeholder="Saran/Masukan tambahan lainnya (opsional)...">
                </div>

                <div class="btn-navigation-container" style="gap: 15px; margin-top: 30px;">
                    <button type="button" class="btn-action btn-secondary" onclick="pindahHalaman('halaman-profil')">
                        <- Kembali ke Profil
                    </button>
                    <button type="submit" id="submitBtn" class="btn-action">
                        Kirim Kuesioner
                    </button>
                </div>

            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>

<div class="modal-overlay" id="resultModal">
    <div class="modal-content">
        <div class="modal-icon">🎉</div>
        <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 5px;">Terima Kasih!</h2>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.95rem;">Kuesioner Anda berhasil dikirimkan.</p>
        
        <div class="score-box">
            <p style="color: #38bdf8; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500;">Detail Penilaian Anda:</p>
            <p style="color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 5px;">Total Skor: <strong id="totalScoreText" style="color: #38bdf8;">0 / 45</strong></p>
            <p style="color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 2px;">Nilai Akhir: <strong id="percentageText" style="color: #38bdf8;">0%</strong></p>
            <div class="score-badge" id="averageScoreText">0.0 / 5</div>
        </div>

        <p id="feedbackCategory" style="color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 25px; line-height: 1.5;"></p>

        <button class="btn-action" onclick="tutupModal()">Tutup & Kembali ke Profil</button>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function() {
        periksaStatusPengisian();
    });

    function periksaStatusPengisian() {
        const sudahMengisi = localStorage.getItem('kuesioner_selesai');
        if (sudahMengisi) {
            pindahHalaman('halaman-kuisoner');
            disableForm();
        }
    }

    function disableForm() {
        const form = document.getElementById('kuesionerForm');
        const elements = form.querySelectorAll('input, button[type="submit"]');
        
        elements.forEach(el => {
            el.disabled = true;
        });

        const submitBtn = document.getElementById('submitBtn');
        if (submitBtn) {
            submitBtn.style.opacity = '0.5';
            submitBtn.style.cursor = 'not-allowed';
            submitBtn.innerText = 'Sudah Diisi';
        }

        const banner = document.getElementById('alreadyFilledBanner');
        if (banner) {
            banner.style.display = 'block';
        }
    }

    function pindahHalaman(idHalaman) {
        const sections = document.querySelectorAll('.page-section');
        sections.forEach(sec => {
            sec.classList.remove('active');
        });

        const targetSection = document.getElementById(idHalaman);
        if (targetSection) {
            targetSection.classList.add('active');
            window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'smooth' });
        }
    }

    document.getElementById('kuesionerForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
        e.preventDefault();

        if (localStorage.getItem('kuesioner_selesai')) {
            alert('Anda sudah pernah mengisi kuesioner ini.');
            return;
        }

        let isValid = true;
        let totalScore = 0;
        let answeredLikertCount = 0;

        document.querySelectorAll('.question-item').forEach(item => {
            item.classList.remove('has-error');
        });

        for (let i = 1; i <= 9; i++) {
            const selectedRating = document.querySelector(`input[name="q${i}"]:checked`);
            const container = document.getElementById(`q${i}_container`);

            if (!selectedRating) {
                isValid = false;
                if (container) container.classList.add('has-error');
            } else {
                totalScore += parseInt(selectedRating.value);
                answeredLikertCount++;
            }
        }

        if (!isValid) {
            const firstError = document.querySelector('.has-error');
            if (firstError) {
                firstError.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
            }
            return;
        }

        const maxScore = answeredLikertCount * 5;
        const averageScore = (totalScore / answeredLikertCount).toFixed(1);
        const percentage = ((totalScore / maxScore) * 100).toFixed(0);

        document.getElementById('totalScoreText').innerText = `${totalScore} / ${maxScore}`;
        document.getElementById('percentageText').innerText = `${percentage}%`;
        document.getElementById('averageScoreText').innerText = `${averageScore} / 5`;
        
        const feedbackElem = document.getElementById('feedbackCategory');
        if (averageScore >= 4.5) {
            feedbackElem.innerHTML = "Luar biasa! Penilaian Anda sangat positif. Terima kasih atas masukan dan dukungan Anda terhadap web profil ini!";
        } else if (averageScore >= 3.5) {
            feedbackElem.innerHTML = "Terima kasih banyak! Penilaian Anda sangat membantu untuk penyempurnaan desain dan informasi di masa mendatang.";
        } else {
            feedbackElem.innerHTML = "Terima kasih atas penilaian dan evaluasinya. Masukan Anda akan dijadikan bahan evaluasi utama untuk pembaruan web profil ini.";
        }

        localStorage.setItem('kuesioner_selesai', 'true');
        disableForm();

        const modal = document.getElementById('resultModal');
        modal.classList.add('active');
    });

    function tutupModal() {
        const modal = document.getElementById('resultModal');
        modal.classList.remove('active');
        
        pindahHalaman('halaman-kuisoner');
    }
</script>

</body>
</html>
